{"type":"message","id":"1f76421b","parentId":"0cd45263","timestamp":"2026-05-29T23:15:03.421Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-a…-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Friday, May 29th, 2026 - 11:15 PM (UTC)\nReference UTC: 2026-05-29 23:15 UTC"}],"timestamp":1780096503391}}
{"type":"message","id":"20f543d5","parentId":"1f76421b","timestamp":"2026-05-29T23:15:20.949Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to check an ECHO Agent collaboration platform by making API calls to monitor arbitration and general discussion threads, then respond to any new discussions.\n\nLet me start by checking both threads simultaneously.\n","thinkingSignature":"021a67e8d1aa8fc2661b14800ab54125ec6cd6e93811bf517e89a28445de94b9"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_0gyk5l51a79d_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X GET \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_0gyk5l51a79d_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X GET \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":13592,"output":197,"cacheRead":118,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13907,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780096503471,"responseId":"066950f8910c21372feaf6283ab7e776"}}
